; XAUUSD_Loma_TrendPullback v1.35 on BTCUSD - best trailing of M30: ATRentry trailing (TrailMode 1), setup 3 of 3: both, session 0700-2000 server time, trend filter none, target 1.5R. DO NOT LOAD ON GOLD.
; Trailing: 1 x ATR(14) of M30 at entry behind the best price once the profit reaches 3 x ATR, stop moved once per closed minute. Needs EA v1.35 or later (TrailMode 1, TrailParam 0).
; Picked on 1 Jan 2025 - 15 May 2026 only, by the one-minute backtest at the study's costs (10 USD spread; score 1.30): 108 trades, PF 1.44. Replay of the same months: 108 trades, PF 1.42.
; REPLAY ON BINANCE BTCUSDT ONE-SECOND PRICES (four price points per second; the EA's rules; 10 USD spread, no commission). 16 May - 13 Nov 2026 (the trailing was chosen on these months): this setup 53 trades, PF 1.28, net +6.4R (stressed PF 1.20); the 3 setups of M30 + ATRentry together 100 trades, PF 1.06, net +2.3R (stressed 1.04).
; ATRentry trailing with its own setups was chosen as the best on M30 (highest PF of the EA's trailing systems with 100+ trades in those months; each system has its own setups), so the 2026 figure is the score it was chosen by, not a test.
; EARLIER DATA, not used for any choice (same replay and costs): this setup: 2024, 95 trades, PF 1.34; 2023 (from 15 Jan), 102 trades, PF 0.65. The 3 setups together: 2024, 219 trades, PF 1.07; 2023 (from 15 Jan), 209 trades, PF 0.63. They did not hold (under 1.3): UNPROVEN, Strategy Tester and demo only.
; Data: Binance BTCUSDT, broker server time. Points are 0.01 USD: 2000 points = 20 USD.
; Times are BROKER SERVER TIME (New York + 7 h: GMT+2 in the US winter, GMT+3 in the US summer).
; UseNewsFilter is on: on demo or live the EA skips entries within 30 minutes of high-impact USD news, which the replay did not do (no effect in the Strategy Tester). Set it to false to trade exactly what was replayed.
